149	// Impact names one dataset directly or indirectly downstream of an impact
150	// query's origin. Distance is the number of lineage edges on the shortest path
151	// from the origin to this dataset (a direct downstream has distance 1), and
152	// Path is that shortest path written from the origin to the dataset, one name
153	// per hop.
